 features, fixing bugs, optimizing retrieval, or documenting the system. What would you like to work on?\n", "command": null}, "content_type": "text"}, "metadata": {"action_file": "memory://6e50c0a5-8b31-40f3-be8e-19859b4a841d_chat_action", "stream_out_type": "/agent/edit", "is_streaming": false, "output": "", "path": "/agent/edit/tool/call"}}
